flowchart TD
    A[Writing or editing a markdown file] --> B{Who reads it?}

    B -->|"Public: package README, CONTRIBUTING,<br/>CHANGELOG, public repo docs, docs-site page"| PUB[Public tier]
    B -->|"Internal: CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md,<br/>rules/, project docs/, trackers"| INT[Internal tier]

    INT --> S[Style rules only]
    PUB --> S

    S --> S1[One H1, no skipped levels]
    S1 --> S2[Every code fence names a language]
    S2 --> S3[Tables for anything enumerable]
    S3 --> S4[Images: alt text + explicit width, SVG master]
    S4 --> S5{Callout needed?}
    S5 -->|GitHub / npm| S6["&gt; [!NOTE|IMPORTANT|WARNING]"]
    S5 -->|Docs site| S7[":::note admonition"]
    S5 -->|No| S8
    S6 --> S8[Single-home rule: one fact, one section]
    S7 --> S8

    S8 --> M{Which tier?}
    M -->|Internal| I1["Last Updated: YYYY-MM-DD"]
    I1 --> DONE

    M -->|Public| P1[Anchor contract applies]

    P1 --> P2["Slug = kebab-case of heading text,<br/>emoji dropped"]
    P2 --> P3{"Slug already used<br/>in this file?"}
    P3 -->|Yes| P4[STOP: duplicate heading.<br/>Rename one — ids collide]
    P4 --> P2
    P3 -->|No| P5["&lt;a id='slug'&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<br/>## EMOJI Title&amp;nbsp;[#](#slug)"]

    P5 --> P6{One emoji per H2<br/>from the section map?}
    P6 -->|H3 or deeper| P7[No emoji — plain heading]
    P6 -->|H2| P8[Emoji from the shared map]
    P7 --> P9
    P8 --> P9{File over ~100 lines?}

    P9 -->|Yes| P10[TOC from H2s only,<br/>above the first H2]
    P9 -->|No| P11
    P10 --> P11{Heading added, renamed,<br/>reordered or removed?}
    P11 -->|Yes| P12[Regenerate the TOC<br/>in the SAME edit]
    P11 -->|No| P13
    P12 --> P13{Link target}

    P13 -->|Same file| P14["Bare fragment: #slug<br/>never write user-content-"]
    P13 -->|Inside the repo| P15[Relative path]
    P13 -->|"Reachable from npmjs.com"| P16[ABSOLUTE URL —<br/>npm renders off-repo,<br/>relative links are dead]

    P14 --> V
    P15 --> V
    P16 --> V[Verify]

    V --> V1[Every TOC entry matches a heading]
    V1 --> V2[No duplicate anchor id]
    V2 --> V3[Every link returns 200/301]
    V3 --> DONE([Done])

    style P4 fill:#ffe0e0,stroke:#c00
    style P16 fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#c90
    style DONE fill:#e0f0e0,stroke:#0a0
